###상품 accessToken으로 등록
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc4MzA5Mjk2MiwiZXhwIjoxNzgzMDk2NTYyfQ.w8NDxdBNBDO9EeLpzAnxMpceAZf8sYVb4vP897DodpQ
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "맥북 에어 M2",
  "description": "미개봉 새상품 맥북 에어 팝니다.",
  "price": 1200000
}

###상품 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

###상품 accessToken으로 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/products/2
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc4MzA5Mjk2MiwiZXhwIjoxNzgzMDk2NTYyfQ.w8NDxdBNBDO9EeLpzAnxMpceAZf8sYVb4vP897DodpQ
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "개봉만 해본 새상품 맥북 에어 팝니다."
}

###상품 accessToken으로 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/2
